that you just explained.

01:00:24.400 --> 01:00:28.573
I demand a written apology
to Ethan and Joel Coen.

01:00:30.120 --> 01:00:32.330
Well I put "The Big
Lebowski" at number two, so.

01:00:32.330 --> 01:00:33.965
Yeah, that's true.

