In this particular rewatching,

01:01:24.157 --> 01:01:25.665
"The Two Towers" was my favorite.

01:01:25.665 --> 01:01:27.240
But what number was it for you?

01:01:27.240 --> 01:01:29.510
It is my number two.

01:01:29.510 --> 01:01:30.460
Okay, yours is number two.

01:01:30.460 --> 01:01:31.667
So my number three.

01:01:31.667 --> 01:01:35.703
So it's not my number three or number one.

01:01:38.130 --> 01:01:40.890
Again, it's one of those things,

01:01:40.890 --> 01:01:43.350
like we said a couple weeks ago,

01:01:43.350 --> 01:01:46.540
you realize, I mean, first
of all, we read the books,

