01:16:13.407 --> 01:16:15.120
and that kind of thing, and, you know,

01:16:15.120 --> 01:16:19.700
the whole like tipper gore,
put parental advisory,

01:16:19.700 --> 01:16:22.760
there's a big aversion to
a lot of that at that time,

01:16:22.760 --> 01:16:24.143
especially in the 90s.

01:16:26.140 --> 01:16:27.579
But we never were really apart of that,

01:16:27.579 --> 01:16:28.760
